  <title>Tool Magazine Adjustment</title>
  <body>
    <header>
      <para styleclass="Heading1">Tool Magazine Adjustment</para>
    </header>
    <para styleclass="Normal">1. Use the ATC–spindle gap tool to verify the clearance between the ATC arm and spindle.</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">2. Adjust the clearance by repositioning the ATC unit using the ATC push‑pull block.</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">3. Verify the ATC tool change position.</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">4. Install the tool magazine level pad; adjust the bolt to achieve contact, then tighten the nut.</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"></para>
